WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.293
I think you all brought some
friends here too with you.

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.212
Can we Say hello to
your little friends?

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:10.885
Bring that gold man with us.

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:13.430
Spoiler alert, this
all worked out.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.111
I'm excited to be with you all
this morning, Academy Gold.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.447
We got the production track,
we got Gold Extension,

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:32.615
we got the alumni
of Academy Gold,

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.951
and our partner company interns.

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:35.910
So welcome to you all.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:40.165
Excited to have you here and for
this bright light of sunshine

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:43.877
that we're going to enjoy
today, the making of Hair Love.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.962
And let me give you
a brief introduction,

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:48.089
and then we're going to
have the special treat that

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.507
gets it all going.

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:52.802
First, we'll be joined
by Matthew A. Cherry, who

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:56.014
is director, writer, producer
of this wonderful Academy

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:59.100
award-winning project,
and joining Matthew

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:03.271
will be Karen Toliver, who's
a producer on the film,

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:06.983
but also an EDP creative
at Sony Pictures Animation.

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:09.402
So with that, we're going to
actually see the short again.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.071
I think some of you
have seen it already

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.990
in advance of the
ceremony last year

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.326
or this year, a lifetime ago.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.036
But let's watch the
short, and then we'll

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.412
dive into the making of it.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:22.415
[VIDEO PLAYBACK]

00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:47.816
- Meow.

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:50.276
- [YAWNING]

00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:44.080
- [HUMMING]

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:51.212
Just took a little bit of
work and a whole lot of love.

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:57.093
- Are you ready to do this?

00:02:57.093 --> 00:02:57.969
All right.

00:02:57.969 --> 00:03:00.471
Here we go.

00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:02.390
See, now wasn't that easy?

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:15.922
- [CROWD CHEERING]

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:16.422
Aw!

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:28.351
- [SIGHING]

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:56.087
- See?

00:04:56.087 --> 00:04:58.298
Now, wasn't that easy?

00:04:58.298 --> 00:05:00.717
All it takes is some
confidence and a willingness

00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:02.343
to get started.

00:05:02.343 --> 00:05:07.307
And even though I'm not there,
I'll guide you through this.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:10.643
I want to thank my very special
assistant, my daughter, Zuri,

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:14.522
for helping me with
today's blog like always.

00:05:14.522 --> 00:05:17.650
And remember, the road
ahead might look rough,

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.528
but you can make the journey
with a little bit of work

00:05:20.528 --> 00:05:22.113
and a whole lot of love.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.252
Are you ready to do this?

00:05:36.252 --> 00:05:38.254
All right, here we go.

00:05:38.254 --> 00:05:41.257
First, you want to moisturize
these beautiful, thick curls

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:43.343
with a leave-in
conditioner, which will also

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.219
help detangle the kinks.

00:05:45.219 --> 00:05:47.805
Now, part all right
your hair into sections,

00:05:47.805 --> 00:05:48.806
and clip it away.

00:05:55.271 --> 00:05:56.898
You're doing an amazing job.

00:06:02.403 --> 00:06:02.904
Yay!

00:06:02.904 --> 00:06:04.655
You did it!

00:06:04.655 --> 00:06:07.950
That was so much fun.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.160
I knew you could do it.

